name: A bounded actor query inherits reasoning, preserves Review and reports partial coverage
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/actor_observations.py seed @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 REVIEW || KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/actor_observations.py before @TMP_TARGET @ART
paste-file: @ART/command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 PREREQUISITE PLAN | prerequisite-review
expect: context:build
keys: a
require-live-snap: 30 Actor-guided observations: 0 findings | observations-produced
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/actor_observations.py result @TMP_TARGET @ART
paste-file: @ART/replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | partial-receipt
expect: partial coverage, independent review required
ask: Does the receipt clearly distinguish bounded actor context and partial coverage from a clean Scan, with one request and the selected medium reasoning?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: receipt-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: receipt-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: receipt-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: receipt-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | receipt-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: partial-page-1-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: partial-page-2-40x12
ask: Are the partial warning, selected context, uncertain spend and paging controls understandable through the six-size matrix?
resize: 120x36
submit: findings
require-live-snap: 20 Viewing Review | existing-review
expect: Labeled greeting observation
ask: Does the empty actor response preserve the existing human decision and avoid implying that the finding was fixed or resolved?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 REVIEW || KUZUSHI | resumed
paste-file: @ART/replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · partial | recovered
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/actor_observations.py restart @TMP_TARGET @ART
ask: Does no-color restart retain the partial receipt, original decision and protected Review without another request or follow-up job?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
